\keepn\sb120\sa120\f0\fs28\b w16 Help Test\b0\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 This help file is w16's own (tests/winhelp/w16test.rtf, built by OpenWatcom's whc). Text in Helv 10, {\b bold}, {\i italic}, {\ul underlined}, {\strike struck out}, {\scaps Small Capitals}, {\f1 Tms Rmn}, {\f2 Courier} and {\fs28 larger}.\par
\pard\li360\ri360\sa60\f0\fs20 A paragraph indented a quarter inch on both sides, long enough to wrap onto a second line in a window of the usual width.\par
\pard\qc\sa60\f0\fs20 A centred line.\par
\pard\qr\sa60\f0\fs20 A line to the right.\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\tx720\sa60\f0\fs20 1.\tab A hanging indent with a tab stop at half an inch.\par
\pard\tx1440\tqr\tx4320\sa60\f0\fs20 Left\tab middle\tab right-aligned\par
\pard\box\sa60\f0\fs20 A boxed paragraph.\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 A jump: {\uldb Second Topic}{\v second}; a popup: {\ul a term}{\v term}; a jump into a secondary window: {\uldb Second in a window}{\v second>win2}; a macro hot spot: {\uldb Macros}{\v macros}.\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 Pictures: \{bmc dot.bmp\} in the text, \{bmc bars.bmp\} sixteen colours.\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 \{bml dot.bmp\}A picture on the left: text flows beside it on its right for as long as the picture is tall, then under it.\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 Hot spots (blue: jump, green: popup, red: macro): \{bmc map.shg\}\par
\pard\sa60\f0\fs20 Two resolutions: \{bmc res.mrb\} and a metafile picture: \{bmc meta.shg\}\par
